WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:03.921
Jeremy climbed into bed.

2
00:00:03.922 --> 00:00:18.593
He slept for a long time.

3
00:00:18.594 --> 00:00:32.263
He got up and ate some soup.

4
00:00:32.264 --> 00:00:38.927
Then he slept again.

5
00:00:38.928 --> 00:00:44.443
In a few days, Jeremy felt much better.

6
00:00:44.444 --> 00:00:47.868
He thought about his friends.

7
00:00:47.869 --> 00:00:51.548
"They were very kind to me," Jeremy said.

8
00:00:51.549 --> 00:00:57.493
"I must thank them."

9
00:00:57.494 --> 00:01:08.784
Jeremy found some books for Ribby.

10
00:01:08.785 --> 00:01:12.153
He made a cake for Jemima.

11
00:01:12.154 --> 00:01:19.522
He picked pretty flowers for Mrs. Rabbit.

12
00:01:19.523 --> 00:01:28.529
Jeremy went to Ribby's house first.

13
00:01:28.530 --> 00:01:32.152
"Shall we read together?" he asked.

14
00:01:32.153 --> 00:01:37.175
"My throat feels scratchy," Ribby croaked.

15
00:01:37.176 --> 00:01:44.208
"I can't read today."

16
00:01:44.209 --> 00:01:47.874
Next Jeremy took the cake to Jemima.

17
00:01:47.875 --> 00:01:50.151
She shook her head.

18
00:01:50.152 --> 00:01:53.832
"I'm not hungry." She moaned.

19
00:01:53.833 --> 00:02:02.370
"I have a fever."

20
00:02:02.371 --> 00:02:10.175
Finally Jeremy went to Mrs. Rabbit's house.

21
00:02:10.176 --> 00:02:13.951
"Thank you for the pretty flowers," she said.

22
00:02:13.952 --> 00:02:22.755
"But I am too sick to enjoy them."

23
00:02:22.756 --> 00:02:29.580
Jeremy hopped home.

24
00:02:29.581 --> 00:02:31.393
He shook his head.

25
00:02:31.394 --> 00:02:34.994
"My friends made such a big fuss," he thought.

26
00:02:34.995 --> 00:02:47.517
"Over a little cold!"

